From 6cb13dd417ff9ff37cb7e5c297f8f462091a78e2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seedds <seedds@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 09:53:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Pad: per-icon size in the button editor (0112)

The button editor's size slider tunes only the selected icon now:
tap an icon to select it (a ring around it, its name in the hint
line), the slider resizes that icon alone (0.7-1.4, live). Each
icon's size is stored per icon in DmPadLineLayout ("sizes"); a
missing size falls back to the legacy global "scale", then 1, so
a V1.3.8 layout migrates with its sizes intact. The glass disc
follows the same per-icon geometry. The menu stays fixed and the
floating stick is not adjustable.
---
